# X Growth Cockpit runs fully offline — no keys required.
#
# OPTIONAL (Phase 2 — AI Hook Lab): wire a backend to replace the template
# rewrites with real AI generation. Copy this file to `.env.local` and set ONE
# of the options below. With neither set, the Hook Lab silently falls back to the
# offline templates — the app works exactly the same, just without AI.

# Option A — Anthropic API (best quality, paid):
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-opus-4-8              # optional override

# Option B — Local Ollama (free, on-device). Install Ollama, `ollama pull <model>`, then:
# OLLAMA_MODEL=llama3.1
# OLLAMA_URL=http://localhost:11434/api/chat   # optional override
